      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "There is no evidence in the literature that coronary artery spasm is induced by indocyanine green (ICG). In the present report, we describe 2 cases who developed chest pain with transient ST elevation on electrocardiograms after intravenous administration of ICG."},
